art+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1785841860041543001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"02990985-3e67-4714-9ee9-f7aae96f2d39","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"62ec-3eb8-45ec-496c"}],"description":"## Context\nThe A6-0b live deployment preflight and final receipt found two pre-existing untracked event JSONs in the persistent review-bot tickets clone while HEAD exactly equalled refs/remotes/origin/tickets:\n\n- 172e-b207-4c18-4243/1785522649620648380-d92b157f-3a3e-4c66-85d9-b5f2ec06499e-TICKET_DIGEST.json\n- 7ab3-9df0-7a90-4ffd/1785820923597137671-b00b8061-e68a-4ab1-8f13-0625c90da09e-CLAIM_ENRICH.json\n\nThey predate the A6-0b deployment. Ref convergence is healthy and there is no tracked diff, merge, rebase, or stash state, but a history rewrite/reset could overwrite or strand these uncommitted artifacts. Do not delete or raw-commit them without determining whether they are unique canonical events or duplicates.\n\n## Plan\n- Inspect only event identity/type/authorship metadata and compare each event UUID/path with the authoritative tickets branch.\n- Determine whether each artifact is unique recoverable data, a duplicate of a committed event, or disposable failed-write residue.\n- Recover unique events through the normal signed store write path, or record evidence supporting explicit deletion if duplicate/disposable.\n- Re-run clone integrity/ref-convergence checks and prove the persistent clone has no untracked event files before the A6-1 publication window.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] [code-verifiable] Each stranded path has a documented identity/duplication determination against authoritative origin/tickets.\n- [ ] [operator-attested] Any unique event is recovered through a normal signed store operation, or explicit operator evidence authorizes discarding a duplicate/disposable file.\n- [ ] [code-verifiable] Persistent review-bot clone HEAD equals refs/remotes/origin/tickets with no tracked or untracked event files, merge, rebase, or stash state.\n- [ ] [operator-attested] The final clean-clone receipt is recorded before the A6-1 reclaim publication window.\n\nNo production source change is presumed; if investigation finds a reproducible writer defect, file a separate code bug with the reproduction.\n\n## Verification\n- Use read-only `git ls-tree`, `git log --all -- <path>`, and event-UUID search against `refs/remotes/origin/tickets` to classify each file.\n- After the authorized recovery/discard operation, record `git status --short --untracked-files=all`, exact HEAD and origin/tickets tips, and absence of MERGE_HEAD, rebase directories, and stashes.\n- Capture commands and exits through SSM without printing repository credentials.","env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"none","keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"Operational inspection/recovery of the persistent production clone; no repository source change is expected unless a separate reproducible writer defect is filed.","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"729195cf-2b43-4403-81b2-6bfe5f3c121e","plan_review_phase":"execution","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":1,"reverts":[],"status":"in_progress","tags":["reviewbot","tickets-store","reclaim"],"ticket_id":"b626-65ee-df80-44dc","ticket_type":"bug","title":"Recover stranded review-bot event files before tickets reclaim","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["5f490d1f-56b0-46da-a147-979c04c7d920","02990985-3e67-4714-9ee9-f7aae96f2d39","51da6566-abb9-427a-8987-9d1626cbad35","28c97b61-1240-461c-901d-48c9f61a2e61","008e531d-ac9e-4a8e-a8a4-1ab3bc81bca9","69398831-ce1c-4243-a988-ffacd3e1354d","729195cf-2b43-4403-81b2-6bfe5f3c121e","40f6d7f4-7902-4896-82c2-f72ea3899088"]},"env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","event_type":"SNAPSH